ut this fearful forest. And to this day none is capable of letting that Yakşiņi from committing ravages right an left.","alignment":{"type":"split","confidence":0.403,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-24-26","DUTT-1-24-27"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1023029","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"b8ffbe9ec41da6f5cd891ae54ed7686ade09b9b7367e029b66bb03b420fe9257","compact":"f2d982dc1751ba43cda4d1952e27ec872fb626c8e5f7203da82d80b02c14138f","nasal":"355a5bf3da7337c13b170813528358bb56c71ee6151f21e3bc3aef657e6acd13"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-23-30","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":23,"verse":30,"english":"O Rāma, by the dreadful and unbearable Yakşiņi. And now I have related to you all about this fearful forest. And to this day none is capable of letting that Yakşiņi from committing ravages right an left.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.889,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-24-27"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1023030","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"b5e7ce0faf446c7ced3cc85d25ba0f877ef64549d2424fbfe034326b15f8e07e","compact":"dd986130ae3f5d437876809cac8a57bb443ea9144249a127488b223cd6fb0015","nasal":"dd986130ae3f5d437876809cac8a57bb443ea9144249a127488b223cd6fb0015"}}]
